cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite ganlive when using it in research, software, or creative work."
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-06"
title: "ganlive: Plug-and-play GAN latent-space exploration in real time"
authors:
  - family-names: Cortal
    given-names: Gustave
abstract: >-
  ganlive is a plug-and-play interface for exploring generative adversarial
  network (GAN) latent spaces in real time. Load a model and ganlive automatically
  derives dials for exploration, played by hand, with MIDI, or from drums.
  It loads StyleGAN2 and FastGAN checkpoints and compatible ONNX generators.
repository-code: "https://github.com/gustavecortal/ganlive"
url: "https://github.com/gustavecortal/ganlive"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - generative adversarial networks
  - latent space exploration
  - real-time visuals
  - MIDI
  - generative art
  - StyleGAN2
  - FastGAN
  - ONNX
